  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize emptying the 4 main slots by moving sequences. Every empty slot is a massive opportunity to play cards that don't fit elsewhere.\n\nThe 'King Save': If you already have cards that fit on a King, wait for an opponent to play their King into a corner first so you don't have to waste your turn filling a corner slot.\n\nSequence Consolidation: Always look for ways to merge existing table piles. This frees up the 4 main slots, which can then be filled with any card, potentially dumping a large part of your hand at once.",
    Player: "Prioritize emptying the 4 main slots by moving sequences. Every empty slot is a massive opportunity to play cards that don't fit elsewhere.\n\nThe 'King Save': If you already have cards that fit on a King, wait for an opponent to play their King into a corner first so you don't have to waste your turn filling a corner slot.\n\nSequence Consolidation: Always look for ways to merge existing table piles. This frees up the 4 main slots, which can then be filled with any card, potentially dumping a large part of your hand at once.",
